sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: State is EVConnectedPreSession

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger the CSMS to request the Charging Station to start a transaction

    CSMS->>CS: RequestStartTransactionRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken><br>idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>

    CS-->>CSMS: RequestStartTransactionResponse (status = Accepted, transactionId = <Generated transactionId>)

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = RemoteStart, transactionInfo.remoteStartId = <By CSMS provided remoteStartID>, eventType = Updated)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted (State is Authorized and _EVConnected = true)
